    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/c80c08-d3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=578147854783087546&sectionId=578147854816707514)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL23hJ4dsa_text","label":"ggL23hJ4dsa_text","default":"FAQ"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQwByvQyPd_text","label":"ggQwByvQyPd_text","default":"<p>Got questions? We’ve got answers!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_0","label":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_0","default":"<p><strong>Is this 100% safe for my pet?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_1","label":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_1","default":"<p>How do I use the product?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_2","label":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_2","default":"<p>Is this a substitute for toothbrushing?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_3","label":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_3","default":"<p>What’s in the formula?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_4","label":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_4","default":"<p>When can I expect results?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_5","label":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_5","default":"<p>Is FreshWipes suitable for all breeds and sizes?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_6","label":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_6","default":"<p>Do the wipes help with bad breath?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_7","label":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_7","default":"<p>How should I store FreshWipes?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_8","label":"ggOPOL5CF7q_childItem_8","default":"<p>What happens if I’m not satisfied?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-gSoihG-2_text","label":"gg-gSoihG-2_text","default":"<p>✅ <strong>Yes! The wipes are made to be as gentle as they are effective.</strong></p><p>They are free from:</p><ul><li>❌ Alcohol<br><br>&nbsp;</li><li>❌ Parabens<br><br>&nbsp;</li><li>❌ Essential oils (which can irritate some pets)<br><br>&nbsp;</li><li>❌ Harsh chemicals or artificial fragrances<br><br>&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Our formula is developed with veterinary insight to ensure safety for both dogs and cats – even those with sensitive gums or skin.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9ogdxg3hD_text","label":"gg9ogdxg3hD_text","default":"<p>Slip the wipe over your finger.</p><ol><li>Gently rub along your pet’s teeth and gums in circular motions.<br><br>&nbsp;</li><li>Focus especially on the gum line and any areas with visible plaque or discoloration.<br>&nbsp;</li></ol><p>No toothbrush. No mess. No stress.</p><p>Use daily or 1–2 times a week for best results.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTNC_0Y-QC_text","label":"ggTNC_0Y-QC_text","default":"<p>For most pet owners: yes.</p><p>Brushing is best – but often unrealistic in everyday life.</p><p><strong>FreshWipes provides a simple and reliable way to care for your pet’s oral health – without the struggle.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLuoTHdNsW_text","label":"ggLuoTHdNsW_text","default":"<p><strong>Only what your pet needs – nothing more.</strong><br><br>Every ingredient is carefully selected to support safe and effective oral care:</p><ul><li>Purified water – gentle base that adds moisture<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Aloe vera – soothes gums and helps reduce irritation<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Natural plant extracts – provide antibacterial protection<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Zinc compounds – freshen breath and fight plaque<br>&nbsp;</li><li>pH-balanced &amp; fragrance-free – safe for sensitive pets<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Cruelty-free – never tested on animals<br>&nbsp;</li><li>No alcohol, fluoride, or harsh chemicals<br>&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>Just safe, simple, and effective dental care – in every wipe.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyK-Z3aqQA_text","label":"ggyK-Z3aqQA_text","default":"<p><strong>🦷 Fresh breath? In just a few days.</strong><br><br>🦷 Cleaner teeth and healthier gums? 2–3 weeks with regular use.</p><p><strong>Hold tight – your pet’s mouth will thank you!</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGpthg5G3D_text","label":"ggGpthg5G3D_text","default":"<p>Yes, the wipes are flexible and work well for everything from small toy breeds to large dogs – and for cats.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiJmeIB0Kt_text","label":"ggiJmeIB0Kt_text","default":"<p>Yes! Antibacterial ingredients and natural breath-fresheners help reduce plaque and bad odor.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguEn3Wh4GN_text","label":"gguEn3Wh4GN_text","default":"<p>Store the container in a cool, dry place. Avoid direct sunlight to maintain moisture in the wipes.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3C6JvqYjK_text","label":"gg3C6JvqYjK_text","default":"Replace this text with your content"}],
